//! Proxies for every NetworkManager D-Bus interface, one module each.
//!
//! Generated by `cargo xtask generate` from the introspection XML of NetworkManager
//! 1.58.0. Do not edit.
//!
//! The `default_path` of each proxy is the one its interface name spells out. That is
//! the real path for the four singletons — `org.freedesktop.NetworkManager` itself and
//! its `Settings`, `AgentManager` and `DnsManager` — so `new(&connection)` reaches
//! them directly. Every other object is found at runtime; build proxies for those with
//! [`ObjectPathExt::proxy`](crate::ObjectPathExt::proxy) or
//! [`ProxyExt::cast`](crate::ProxyExt::cast).

